                        <button class="btn btn-sm btn-secondary" type="button" id="btnRefreshCardsAdmin"><i class="fas fa-sync-alt"></i> Refresh</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <p class="text-muted small">Pending card requests show tier, fee, and pay asset. Approve activates; Reject refunds the fee. Wired to <code>/api/admin/users/:id/cards*</code>.</p>
                        <div id="pendingCardsBox" class="table-responsive mb-3"><div class="text-muted small">Loading pending…</div></div>
                        <div class="row g-2 mb-3">
                            <div class="col-md-3"><input class="form-control form-control-sm" id="cardAdminUserId" placeholder="User ID"></div>
